  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1466580/description_694848d5-38e0-4728-a4a0-943c7f475a86.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"400\"></p><h6 style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</h6><p style=\"text-align:left\">為 Minecraft 新增了 <span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>獄髓升級模板</strong></span> 的合成配方，提供另一種取得方式。您不再只能透過 <strong>探索地獄</strong>，現在可以直接合成升級模板，更直接地邁向 <em>獄髓裝備。</em></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1466580/description_25849c68-9798-4477-b606-cc74753a05ca.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"354\"></em></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1466580/description_d78b9e20-08f1-4a94-ad38-2526b90557fc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"354\"></em></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1466580/description_b9829ff1-130d-43be-8414-dd9a5b782a6b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"354\"></em></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><em><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2iMNfYHBVtE\" width=\"850\" height=\"477\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></em></p>",
